OL,3,GNEWSAMP criticises Channel 4
OL,4,Adocumentary about ADHD
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP with ADHD has criticised a
OL,7,FChannel 4 documentary about the
OL,8,Fcondition, claiming it was "unfactual".
OL,10,FDescribing the documentary as "boring",
OL,11,FLiberal Democrat MP for Yeovil Adam
OL,12,FDance said some aspects of the
OL,13,Fdocumentary were "not reflective of
OL,14,Freal life".
OL,16,FThe programme, entitled The Great ADHD
OL,17,FMyth?, was broadcast on Tuesday and its
OL,18,Fhost, NHS psychiatrist Dr Max
OL,19,FPemberton, concluded ADHD was "a social
OL,20,Fconstruct, not a disorder of the
OL,21,Fbrain".
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
