OL,3,GNEWSAMP criticises Channel 4
OL,4,Adocumentary about ADHD
OL,5,
OL,6,FChannel 4 defended the show, saying
OL,7,Fthere was "considerable public debate
OL,8,Fon various aspects of ADHD" and it was
OL,9,F"legitimate for that debate to be
OL,10,Fexplored and for conventional
OL,11,Funderstandings to be challenged".
